1b5496f0 (512 1792209292492 "guenchi" (("w5vbequy" . 14982)) (put ((kind . section) (title . "landing f167b") (src . "an absent store creates nothing: the client and the daemon refuse before any directory, lock or log\n\nThe client's start path and theourgiad's preflight both answer store-not-found when the\nstore's meta.sexp is observed absent, before the run root, the lock, the socket directory\nor the log exist; the exited fallback re-checks the same predicate so a daemon that died\non an absent store is reported by that cause. An unreadable meta.sexp is not absence: the\nstore process judges and reports it as before. Under --detach every refusal and table\nreport printed before the detach goes to stderr, since the client's stdout carries one\nanswer; --detach without --log is still judged as a usage error first. The two programs\nare the entry points; the library procedure serve is internal and says so.\n") (parent . root) (ord . 410))))
