a027fcba (607 1792222085734 "guenchi" (("w5vbequy" . 14982)) (put ((kind . section) (title . "landing f29ar") (src . "test: import-git reads every answer's exit status and kept count, the lang of inserted blocks, and the fresh refusal's done-block term\n\nThe dry runs and the real reruns read their exit status and the matcher's kept count; the\nrefused runs read their exit status; a range imported, reversed and imported again under a\nnew name is refused as base-mismatch while its done block stays, so the fresh state's\ncondition is read on its own; an added file, its children and a child inserted into an\nexisting file carry the language of the path, a file of no known language none.\n") (parent . root) (ord . 413))))
